<div class="header">
  <h5 style="float:left">Terms & Conditions</h5>
  <ion-icon style="float: right;" name="close-outline" (click)="dismiss()"></ion-icon>
</div>
<br>
<section style="background-color:white">
  <div>
    <ul>
      <li>{{inclExcl}}</li>
      <li *ngIf="data=='02'">Additional rent of RS.6000/-per hour will
        be charged for each extended hour.</li>
      <li *ngIf="data == '02'">This has been concurred in by Finance
        Department vide Noting-65 in the OSWAS file
        HOME-BE_MISC-0005-2022.</li>
      <li>The reservation in any bhawan may be
        cancelled in visit of Hon'ble Governor, Hon'ble CM,Hon'ble Chief
        justice of orissa High court or any other state govt.
        programs or sponsored programs.</li>
      <li>In case of cancellation of reservation from
        office side,you are requested to contact the manager of
        concerned bhawan for refund if any amount paid.</li>
      <li>The amount paid towards booking of the
        Confernce hall/Auditorium/MP hall/Open Terrace/Lounge is
        non-refundable.</li>
      <li>The acknowledgement/receipt is to be
        produced before the manager for the concerened Bhawan prior to
        use of Conference hall/Auditorium/MP hall/Open Terrace/Lounge.</li>
    </ul>
    <!-- <ion-button type="button" style="float: right;">Close</ion-button> -->
  </div>
</section>